  ],
  "leakage_rules": "In every condition, donor evidence included: the current episode is excluded from prior cases, Investment Memory sections mentioning the pitched company are filtered, and the pitch is the main evaluation's founders-only pitch cut at the first panel decision.",
  "measures": {
    "rationales": "investor lens output; recall/precision/F1 at dimension, rationale, rationale+direction level",
